sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin as Platform Admin
  participant Handler as Webhook Handler
  participant Inbound as Inbound Endpoint
  participant Outbound as Outbound Endpoint
  participant Event as Inbound Event
  participant Delivery as Outbound Delivery
  participant Queue as Queue Worker

  Admin->>Handler: Configure handler direction and mode
  Admin->>Inbound: Link inbound endpoint to handler
  Admin->>Outbound: Link outbound endpoint to handler

  alt Inbound orchestration
    Inbound->>Event: Create event from validated request
    Event->>Handler: Invoke rule engine or callback
    Handler->>Queue: Enqueue business action
    Queue->>Event: Mark done or dead_letter
  else Outbound orchestration
    Handler->>Delivery: Create delivery from business event
    Delivery->>Queue: Enqueue transport job
    Queue->>Handler: Invoke outbound pre-send hook
    Queue->>Delivery: Mark done, retry, or dead_letter
  end
